R(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=SRC&object=EGFR&type=Activation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">381</a>)<li/>SRC inhibits EGFR(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=SRC&object=EGFR&type=Inhibition&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">37</a>)<li/>SRC increases the amount of EGFR(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=SRC&object=EGFR&type=IncreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">12</a>)<li/>SRC dephosphorylates EGFR(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=SRC&object=EGFR&type=Dephosphorylation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">12</a>)<li/>SRC decreases the amount of EGFR(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=SRC&object=EGFR&type=DecreaseAmount&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">8</a>)<li/>EGFR activates SRC(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=EGFR&object=SRC&type=Activation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">210</a>)<li/>EGFR phosphorylates SRC(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=EGFR&object=SRC&type=Phosphorylation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">66</a>)<li/>EGFR inhibits SRC(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=EGFR&object=SRC&type=Inhibition&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">17</a>)<li/>EGFR dephosphorylates SRC(<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?subject=EGFR&object=SRC&type=Dephosphorylation&format=html&expand_all=true\" target=\"INDRA_Evidence\">5</a>)</ul>","__edge_source":"INDRA","__relationship_score":7.558516743045645,"__directed":true,"__reverse_directed":true,"i":"interacts with"}},{"id":91,"s":11,"t":13,"v":{"Relationships":"All Evidences (<a href=\"https://db.indra.bio/statements/from_agents?agent0=FYN&agent1=SRC&format=html&expand_all=false\" target=\"INDRA_